const cosmicReadings=[["ROOM TO BE YOURSELF, ROOM TO BE CLOSE.", "Your Aquarius Sun, Cancer Moon and Pisces Rising bring an interesting conversation to the same table: the wish to think freely, the wish to feel at home, and a soft, imaginative way of meeting the world. Read together, this combination invites closeness that still leaves room for your own voice.", "Today’s theme is letting those wishes cooperate. You can enjoy someone’s company and still want quiet time afterward. You can understand a situation intellectually and still need a little reassurance. If that tension feels familiar, try naming both needs instead of choosing which one is allowed to matter.", "In a conversation, let Aquarius help you say what you mean, Cancer help you say why it matters, and Pisces help you say it with warmth. A simple “I’d love to spend time together, and I also need a quiet evening” can hold all three.", "Where would a little more freedom and a little more reassurance help you feel like yourself?"], ["LET YOUR HEAD AND HEART COMPARE NOTES.", "In the language of your big three, Aquarius looks for perspective, Cancer looks for emotional safety, and Pisces notices atmosphere and possibility. Together, they suggest a useful theme: thoughtful sensitivity. There is room for both a clear explanation and a feeling you haven’t quite found words for yet.", "Today, imagine letting your head and heart compare notes. If something is on your mind, separate what you know from what you’re interpreting and what you wish you could ask for. An impression can be a starting point for a question; it doesn’t have to become your conclusion.", "Give yourself a gentle pause before an important reply. Then ask one clear question or express one honest need. Curiosity, care and a little breathing room can work together.", "What do I know, what am I feeling, and what would I like to ask?"], ["MAKE SOMETHING THAT FEELS LIKE YOU.", "Aquarius brings the unconventional idea, Cancer brings the personal meaning, and Pisces brings the imagination. Combined, your big three offer a lovely creative lens: something can be original without losing its warmth, and meaningful without needing to be polished.", "Today’s reading is an invitation to give an idea a small, tangible home. A playlist, a meal, a note, a little change to your space—choose something that interests your mind and feels good to live with. Let the personal touch be part of what makes it special.", "If you catch yourself judging the result too early, return to the feeling you wanted to create. Make a first version and enjoy it before deciding whether it needs improving.", "What could I make today that combines a fresh idea with a familiar comfort?"], ["BE KIND WITHOUT DISAPPEARING.", "Your Aquarius Sun can symbolize independence, while your Cancer Moon and Pisces Rising bring themes of care and receptivity. The combined reading asks how to stay generous while keeping your own preferences visible. Warmth and a clear boundary can belong in the same sentence.", "Today’s theme is a thoughtful yes. Before offering your time or energy, pause long enough to check whether you want to and whether you have room. Being attentive to another person doesn’t require making their wish your responsibility.", "Try a kind, specific answer: “I can help with this part,” or “I’d like to, but another day works better.” Let Aquarius supply clarity and the water signs supply tenderness.", "Where would a clearer answer make an interaction feel easier for both of us?"], ["CHOOSE CONNECTION WITH BREATHING ROOM.", "Read together, Aquarius Sun, Cancer Moon and Pisces Rising can explore the balance between belonging and individuality. Aquarius values being met as your own person; Cancer brings the wish for consistency; Pisces adds imagination and tenderness to the exchange.", "Today, make room for connection that feels easy to inhabit. That might mean sharing an unusual thought with someone you trust, enjoying a familiar ritual together, or asking directly for the sort of company you want. You don’t have to make every interaction deep for it to be meaningful.", "Offer one small invitation and leave room for an honest response. Notice which moments let you be curious, comfortable and unguarded at the same time.", "Which connection gives me space to be myself as well as a sense of being welcome?"], ["GIVE A SOFT DAY SOME SHAPE.", "Aquarius can bring a wider view, Cancer a grounding ritual, and Pisces an openness to wandering and imagining. Together, they offer today’s theme: enough structure to feel supported, enough space to enjoy what appears.", "Rather than filling every hour, pick a gentle anchor. Plan one thing you’re curious about and one thing that feels restorative. Let the rest of the day have a little room around it. A simple rhythm can support both independence and comfort.", "A favorite breakfast followed by a new walking route, or a quiet hour followed by a friendly catch-up, could hold that balance. Choose the version that suits your actual energy.", "What small anchor would make room for a little more ease and curiosity?"], ["KEEP THE INSIGHT, RELEASE THE PRESSURE.", "For this reading, your Aquarius Sun is the observer, your Cancer Moon the keeper of what matters, and your Pisces Rising the imaginative thread connecting the two. Together, they invite a reflective ending: understand something about the week without needing to solve everything in it.", "Notice a moment when you felt free, a moment when you felt supported, and a moment when you felt inspired. The overlap may tell you something about the conditions you want more of. Let the difficult moments offer information rather than a verdict about yourself.", "Carry one useful insight into tomorrow. Then do something that lets the week settle—a little tidying, a warm conversation, music, or some quiet time.", "What helped me feel both independent and cared for, and how could I make a little more room for it?"]];
cosmicReadings.push(...[["A DIFFERENT WAY TO BEGIN.", "Your Aquarius Sun is the fresh perspective, Cancer Moon the need for a comfortable base, and Pisces Rising the imaginative first impression. Today’s combined theme is beginning gently without needing to begin conventionally.", "An unusual idea can feel easier to try when something familiar surrounds it. Let a favorite ritual give your curiosity somewhere to land.", "Try one new thing inside an ordinary routine. Give the experiment room to be imperfect.", "Where could familiarity support a little adventure?"], ["LET A CLEAR REQUEST CARRY THE FEELING.", "Aquarius, Cancer and Pisces meet here as clarity, care and imagination. Today’s reading is about giving a feeling language that another person can understand.", "You may want someone to sense what you need, but a specific request can make closeness easier. Picture the kind of support you would enjoy, then name a small version of it.", "Ask for company, quiet time or help with one concrete thing. Leave room for the other person’s honest answer.", "What could I ask for more clearly?"], ["FOLLOW THE INTEREST, KEEP YOUR ANCHOR.", "Aquarius brings curiosity, Cancer a sense of home, and Pisces the invitation to wander. Together they make a useful symbolic lens for exploring without losing your footing.", "Today, give attention to something because it interests you. An unfamiliar topic, a new song or a different route can be enough. You do not need to turn every discovery into a project.", "Enjoy one small discovery and return to a familiar comfort afterward.", "What am I curious about for its own sake?"], ["YOU CAN CHANGE YOUR MIND WITH WARMTH.", "Your Aquarius Sun can stand for independent judgment, Cancer Moon for care, and Pisces Rising for a gentle approach. Together, today’s theme is revising a choice without treating that revision as a failure.", "A thoughtful change of mind can include both what you learned and consideration for anyone affected. You can explain the adjustment without defending every previous step.", "Name what changed, say what you prefer now, and offer one clear next step.", "What choice would fit better with what I know now?"], ["MAKE ROOM FOR AN UNEXPECTED JOY.", "Aquarius suggests novelty, Cancer suggests comfort, and Pisces suggests imagination. Combined, they invite a pleasure that is a little surprising and still feels like you.", "Leave one small space in the day unassigned. It might hold a funny conversation, a new recipe or an ordinary scene you want to photograph. Enjoyment does not need a measurable outcome.", "Follow a harmless whim for a few minutes. Notice what feels good without making it a task.", "What would be fun without needing to be useful?"], ["LET HOME HOLD A LITTLE POSSIBILITY.", "Read as one story, Aquarius wants space for ideas, Cancer wants somewhere to settle, and Pisces wants atmosphere. Today’s theme is a personal space that supports all three.", "A small change can make a familiar place more inviting: a book within reach, music you like, or a cleared corner for coffee. Choose how you want the space to feel before choosing what to add.", "Make one easy adjustment and spend a moment enjoying it.", "What would make my everyday space feel more like mine?"], ["SAVE THE MOMENT, NOT THE SCORECARD.", "Aquarius is today’s observer, Cancer the keeper of meaningful moments, and Pisces the storyteller. Together, they invite remembering the week through experiences rather than totals.", "Think of something that surprised you, something that comforted you and something that made you smile. The combination may reveal a kind of day you want more often.", "Write down one moment worth remembering. Let it stand without asking whether the week was good enough.", "Which moment would I like to carry with me?"]]);
